{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/Animation.gif?t=1743477509\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235830?t=1743477509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235830?t=1743477509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/4f587e721a0cd77f8880308dd8944780758de900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743477509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/4f587e721a0cd77f8880308dd8944780758de900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743477509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/Animation.gif?t=1743477509\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>","developers":["SurFun","SurFun"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/ff878f6644c3c62d4ad4d5e41d52238733e4bf9d/header.jpg?t=1743477509","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120793,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120793/movie480.mp4?t=1743477504","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120793/movie_max.mp4?t=1743477504"},"name":"\u57fa\u672c\u52d5\u753b","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam